# The Circle tool on the sketch example: a click for the centre and one on
# the rim draw K1; the radius 30cm typed in a burst draws K2; a centre on E
# and a rim on O draw K3, which passes through O: on(O, K3). Esc quits.
open docs/instances/sketch-basic.json
wait 16
action tool.circle
wait 2
click L 724 307
click L 772 307
wait 2
click L 724 371
move 756 371 3
wait 2
text "30cm"
key Enter
wait 2
click L 837 532
click L 321 532
wait 2
key Escape
wait 2
